<title>JAPAN: Daika Sec says to announce merger with Maruko Sec.</title>
<headline>Daika Sec says to announce merger with Maruko Sec.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA, Japan 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osaka-based brokerage Daika Securities Co Ltd said on Monday that it would officially announce a merger with Maruko Securities Co Ltd, based in Tokyo, at noon (0300 GMT) in both Tokyo and Osaka.</p>
<p>The two are medium-sized brokers and their shares are not listed.</p>
<p>Nippon Life Insurance Co, a major shareholder in both firms, has been promoting the merger, the Nihon Keizai Shimbun reported at the weekend.</p>
<p>The merger is expected to take place in October 1997, the newspaper said.</p>
</text>
